    DESCRIPTION
            "lcsStatusConfigAntiTheftProtectionState fix typo in enumeration"
    REVISION "201904030000Z"  -- April 3, 2019
    DESCRIPTION
            "Setup/Interfaces/Mobile/Profiles/Profiles size reduced to 15.
            Rename lcsSetupIpv6Dhcpv6ServerReservationsEntryClientId to
            lcsSetupIpv6Dhcpv6ServerReservationsEntryClient-ID.
            lcsStatusVcCllMngrUsersEntryIfc new values.
